WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:28.980
Ann led Tom to his lab.

2
00:00:28.981 --> 00:00:39.866
She showed him a tiny door.

3
00:00:39.867 --> 00:00:46.821
"The last wizard kept things in this secret room."

4
00:00:46.822 --> 00:00:49.960
Ann looked around the secret room.

5
00:00:49.961 --> 00:00:52.259
"We need a potion to—"

6
00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.405
Just then there was a soft meow.

7
00:00:55.406 --> 00:01:04.358
"Cat?" Tom said in surprise.

8
00:01:04.359 --> 00:01:08.644
"I found the secret door too," Cat said to Tom.

9
00:01:08.645 --> 00:01:16.585
"And look—I already found a potion!"

10
00:01:16.586 --> 00:01:20.094
Tom told Ann what Cat said.

11
00:01:20.095 --> 00:01:23.294
"Let's mix the potion," Ann said.

12
00:01:23.295 --> 00:01:26.033
"Huh?" Tom looked at her.

13
00:01:26.034 --> 00:01:32.669
"I love my father," Ann said.

14
00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:35.981
"But you have a kind heart, Tom.

15
00:01:35.982 --> 00:01:52.663
Father treats you and Cat unfairly."

16
00:01:52.664 --> 00:02:07.307
The next day the royal family returned.

17
00:02:07.308 --> 00:02:10.232
Tom bowed before the queen.

18
00:02:10.233 --> 00:02:13.957
"I missed Your Highness greatly," he said.

19
00:02:13.958 --> 00:02:16.616
Then Tom held out a cup.

20
00:02:16.617 --> 00:02:21.380
"I made a royal potion for you."

21
00:02:21.381 --> 00:02:24.433
"Why, Tom!" The queen blushed.

22
00:02:24.434 --> 00:02:26.154
"Thank you!"

23
00:02:26.155 --> 00:02:37.106
The queen gulped down the potion.

24
00:02:37.107 --> 00:02:40.583
Tom held his breath as Cat appeared.

25
00:02:40.584 --> 00:02:42.361
Dirk scowled.

26
00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:45.436
"You'll be gone soon, Wizard!"

27
00:02:45.437 --> 00:02:48.594
"What's going on?" the king shouted.

28
00:02:48.595 --> 00:02:53.935
Everyone watched the queen.

29
00:02:53.936 --> 00:03:02.576
"Ah—" She gasped but she didn't sneeze.

30
00:03:02.577 --> 00:03:07.632
"You cured me, Tom!" she said happily.

31
00:03:07.633 --> 00:03:13.210
She petted Cat.

32
00:03:13.211 --> 00:03:19.475
"Let there be cats in the palace!" shouted the king.

33
00:03:19.476 --> 00:03:35.809
Dirk stomped away as everyone cheered.

